	(property "Description" "LCDWIKI ES3C28P 4-GPIO socket P3 (Expanded IO) on a JST PH B4B-PH-K-S header, 2.0mm, pins 1:1. Pin 1 IO2, pin 2 IO3, pin 3 IO14, pin 4 IO21: ESP32-S3 GPIOs, bidirectional, 3.3V logic, no resistor on the ES3C28P. No GND pin. GPIO3 is a strapping pin. Pin order from the LCDWIKI schematic and print."
